~ start
Wisowl: [[Hi|Hello|Good morning]] and welcome to Bloomrise!
Wisowl: I'm Wisowl, your guide and companion on this wonderful journey.
Wisowl: Before you start, would you like a quick tutorial?
- Yes, please. => tutorial
- No, I already know everything. => skip_tutorial

~ skip_tutorial
Wisowl: Oho, a confident spirit! I like that. Good luck out there! 🌟
@mutation tool_pickaxe
@mutation tool_axe
@mutation tool_tiller
@mutation tool_watering_can
@mutation rose_seeds
@mutation add_tasks
=> END

~ tutorial
Wisowl: Fantastic! Let’s get you started. 🌟
Wisowl: First things first — let's gather some basic resources! 🪨🌳
@mutation tool_pickaxe
@mutation tool_axe
Wisowl: I just gave you a Pickaxe and an Axe!
Wisowl: Equip them from your toolbar (use Left Mouse Button), then click Q on rocks and trees to gather materials.
Wisowl: Stones and wood are valuable resources — you can sell them to earn coins! 🪙
Wisowl:  Gather a few resources, then we'll move on!
@mutation checkpoint_after_gathering

~ pause
Wisowl: Gathered some materials? Ready for the next step?
- Yes, show me more! => inventory_tip
- Still collecting... => wait_more_after_gathering

~ wait_more_after_gathering
Wisowl: No rush — explore and gather as much as you like! 🪨🌳
@mutation checkpoint_after_gathering


~ inventory_tip
Wisowl: Now, let’s take a look at your Inventory! 🎒
Wisowl: Press E to open your Inventory. You can see there your collected stones and logs.
Wisowl: To move an item to your toolbar, click it with LMB.
Wisowl: To throw an item away, right-click it (RMB).
Wisowl: If you want to move an item back from the toolbar into your inventory, right-click it again (RMB).
Wisowl: Explore your inventory a bit and come back when you're ready. 🎒
@mutation checkpoint_after_inv

~ after_inv_pause
Wisowl: Did you check your inventory?
- Yes, let's continue! => chest_tip
- I need a moment. => wait_more_after_inv

~ wait_more_after_inv
Wisowl: Take your time exploring your inventory. 🎒
@mutation checkpoint_after_inv

~ chest_tip
Wisowl: In your house you will find a Chest! To open it, stand close to the chest and click on it.
Wisowl: Hold Shift while clicking to move items between your inventory and the chest.
Wisowl: Feel free to check out your house and explore a bit before we continue. 🏡
@mutation checkpoint_after_chest

~ after_chest_pause
Wisowl: Ready to plant something?
- Let’s do it!  => planting
- IGive me a moment. => wait_more_after_chest

~ wait_more_after_chest
Wisowl: Take your time. Explore your house and the surroundings. 🏠
@mutation checkpoint_after_chest

~ planting
Wisowl: Great! You need to prepare the soil first.
@mutation tool_tiller
@mutation rose_seeds
Wisowl: I've given you a Tiller. Use it to till the ground and get it ready for planting. Also, you can "untill" the ground using CAPSLOCK.
Wisowl: Then, select the Seeds and plant them! 🌹
Wisowl:  Practice and come back when you're ready.
@mutation checkpoint_after_planting

~ after_planting_pause
Wisowl: Seeds planted? Time to water!
- Yes, ready! => watering
- I need a moment. => wait_more_after_planting

~ wait_more_after_planting
Wisowl: Planting takes patience. Take your time! 🌱
@mutation checkpoint_after_planting

~ watering
Wisowl: Here's a Watering Can! 🌱💧
@mutation tool_watering_can
Wisowl: Water your plants every day to keep them healthy and help them grow strong.
Wisowl: Give it a try!
@mutation checkpoint_after_watering

~ after_watering_pause
Wisowl: One last thing — follow the road from your house to find the shop! 🛒
Wisowl: You can sell your goods and buy new seeds there.
=> end_conversation

~ end_conversation
Wisowl: That's all I can teach you for now.
Wisowl: Good luck, Bloomseeker! 🌟
Wisowl: Your journey in Bloomrise begins!
=> END
